["<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">宇</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>天；屋檐；屋顶；房屋</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">宇宙</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">うちゅう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">宇宙；宇宙空间；太空</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">巨</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>巨大；宏大；伟大</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">キョ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">巨大</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きょだい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">巨大；庞大</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">震</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>震动；颤抖；发抖；摇动；使震动</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ふる.う・ふる.える・ふる.わせる・ふる.わす</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">地震</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">じしん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">地震</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">震える</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ふるえる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">颤抖；发抖；震颤；战栗；哆嗦</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">震わせる</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ふるわせる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">使…颤动；使…震动；使…摇晃；使…振动</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">希</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>希望；请求；稀少；希腊；稀释</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">キ・ケ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">まれ・こいねが.う</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">希望</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きぼう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">希望；愿望；抱负；（光明的）前景；期待；展望</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">触</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>接触；触摸；感觉；冲突；宣告</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ショク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ふ.れる・さわ.る・さわ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">触る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さわる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">触摸；感触；摸；涉及；接近；有害于；妨碍；干扰；刺激</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">触れる</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ふれる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">接触；触摸；感受；用…接触；用…触摸；体验；接触；感知；察觉；涉及；提及；言及；提起；提到；抵触；违反（法律、版权等）；侵犯；宣布；公告；散布（谣言等）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">感触</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かんしょく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">触感；手感；质地；感觉；感受；印象</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">依</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>依靠；根据；因此；由于；依赖</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">イ・エ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\