ss=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">巻</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>卷（卷轴）；卷（书籍册数）；卷（量词）；卷起；缠绕</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">カン・ケン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ま.く・まき・ま.き</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">寝巻</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ねまき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">睡衣；睡袍；睡眠服</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">巻く</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">まく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">缠绕；卷起；包裹；戴（头巾、围巾等）；包住；笼罩；迂回；绕过；联句；提前（三小时等）；提前进行</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">巻</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">まき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">卷；卷轴；（钟表等的）上弦；卷紧；卷；册；加速；提速；（日式木屐的）鞋跟</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">燃</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>燃烧；点燃；烧毁；发光；发亮</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ネン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">も.える・も.やす・も.す</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">燃える</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">もえる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">燃烧；着火；激情高涨</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">燃やす</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">もやす</span><span class=\"k-wz\">燃烧；点燃；燃烧；激昂</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">燃焼</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ねんしょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">燃烧；燃烧作用；竭尽全力；奋力；尽力</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">跡</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>痕迹；足迹；遗迹；印记</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">