</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">コ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">やと.う</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">雇う</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">やとう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">雇用；聘用；雇佣；包租（车、船等）；租用（车、船等）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">雇用</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こよう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">雇用；雇佣；聘用</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">替</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>交换；替代；代替；备用；替换</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">タイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">か.える・か.え-・か.わる</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">取り替える</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">とりかえる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">交换；互换；掉换；兑换；替换；更换；代替</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">両替</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">りょうがえ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">兑换；换钱</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">替える</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かえる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">替换；转换；改变；交换；互换；更新；替代（人员、职员、选手等）</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">預</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>寄存；委托；保管；托付</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ヨ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">あず.ける・あず.かる</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">預ける</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">あずける</span><span class=\"k-wz\">托付；寄存；委托；存放；委托；交由；让……决定；靠；倚；倚靠；把身体靠在……上</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">預かる</